```Title: Public IP or Internet Connectivity Lookup Service in Command Line (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1016.001 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 4315208a-2f8d-4e73-a475-15498af51a4e```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: IT scripts and VPN or monitoring tools that check the public IP```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(CommandLine IN ("*api.ipify.org*", "*ifconfig.me*", "*icanhazip.com*", "*ipinfo.io*", "*checkip.amazonaws.com*", "*myip.opendns.com*", "*ip-api.com*", "*wtfismyip.com*", "*checkip.dyndns.org*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
